# The compiled CSS and JS are committed deliberately.
#
# This app is run straight from a clone with `php artisan serve`, so a pull
# that does not also bring the built assets leaves the browser on whatever
# was compiled last -- which looks like a broken interface rather than a
# missing build step. If you add a deploy pipeline that runs `npm run build`,
# re-ignore this directory.
